    "durationEn": "Instantaneous",
    "descriptionEn": "You point at a place within range, and a glowing 1-foot ball of emerald acid streaks there and explodes in a 20-foot radius. Each creature in that area must make a Dexterity saving throw. On a failed save, a creature takes 10d4 acid damage and 5d4 acid damage at the end of its next turn. On a successful save, a creature takes half the initial damage and no damage at the end of its next turn.",
    "higherLevelsEn": "When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 5th level or higher, the initial damage increases by 2d4 for each slot level above 4th."
